        "lines": [
          "Refuge in the Lord"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. Of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I have taken refuge in the Lord.",
          "How can you say to me,",
          "“Escape to the mountains like a bird!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For look, the wicked string bows;",
          "they put their arrows on bowstrings",
          "to shoot from the shadows at the upright in heart."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When the foundations are destroyed,",
          "what can the righteous do? ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord is in his holy temple;",
          "the Lord #— #his throne is in heaven.",
          "His eyes watch;",
          "his gaze examines everyone."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord examines the righteous,",
          "but he hates the wicked",
          "and those who love violence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let him rain burning coals and sulfur on the wicked;",
          "let a scorching wind be the portion in their cup."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the Lord is righteous; he loves righteous deeds.",
          "The upright will see his face."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
